WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.609
KINGO
You're about to meet the greatest warriors

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:04.276
the world has ever known.

00:00:05.234 --> 00:00:06.131
Legendary.

00:00:07.523 --> 00:00:08.425
Fashionable.

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:10.184
Powerful.

00:00:11.891 --> 00:00:12.656
PHASTOS
Well, I'm sure that was

00:00:12.707 --> 00:00:13.706
a lot of fun for you.

00:00:13.757 --> 00:00:14.389
THENA
It was.

00:00:15.894 --> 00:00:17.355
(The Marvel universe...)

00:00:17.406 --> 00:00:18.402
IKARIS
Play nice.

00:00:18.453 --> 00:00:19.978
(...becomes eternal.)

00:00:20.029 --> 00:00:21.550
JACK
So what's your super power?

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.902
PHASTOS
You know that your babysitting privileges

00:00:23.953 --> 00:00:25.400
are completely revoked, right?

